{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07899","headline":"同独孤使君东斋作 · 孟浩然","name":"同独孤使君东斋作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郎官旧华省，天子命分忧。\n襄土岁频旱，随车雨再流。\n云阴自南楚，河润及东周。\n廨宇宜新霁，田家贺有秋。\n竹间残照入，池上夕阳浮。\n寄谢东阳守，何如八咏楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}